<title>HONG KONG: UBS sets call warrants on HK shares.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on HK shares.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland Hong Kong Branch said it launched 200 million American-style call warrants on a basket of five locally-listed property-shares.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p> New World Development Ltd		     0.1 shares</p>
<p> Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd		    0.1 shares</p>
<p> Henderson Land Development Co Ltd	   0.08 shares</p>
<p> HKR International Ltd			   0.25 shares</p>
<p> Sino Land Co Ltd				  0.30 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$22.95	 PREMIUM	 12.3PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.418	 GEARING	 5.78x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  02.JAN.98	PAYDATE	 10.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	LISTING DATE  15.JAN.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$24.16	 EXER LOT	10,000</p>
<p> MANAGER    UBS Securities (Hong Kong) Ltd</p>
<p>		Tai Fook Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p>		Vickers Ballas Hong Kong Ltd</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
